\par\par \b \uc2  S.Korea Won Sharply Dn At Midmorning Despite BOK Dlr Selling \b0\par\par\uc2 238 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 Oktober 1997\par 03:11\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SEOUL (AP-Dow Jones)--The South Korean won is sharply lower early Monday, despite the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's effort to defend the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  through several dollar-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Around 0152 GMT (8:52 p.m. EST), the dollar was trading at 939.90 won, compared with 929.70 won around an hour earlier and compared with 929.50 won at Friday's close. \par \par \uc2  Fears of financial instability at home and across the region is prompting fears foreigners will continue to flee investment in Asia. \par \par \uc2  'There is just so much negative sentiment toward the stability of the local economy and of the economies of Asia,' said a local dealer. 'That bearish sentiment is putting enormous downward pressure on the won, despite the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's efforts to support the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .' \par \par \uc2  He said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  throughout the day, selling dollars to slow the won's sharp pace of depreciation. \par \par \uc2  As reported, \b \highlight22\uc2 South Korea\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Korea \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  around 0140 GMT (8:40 p.m. EST), selling dollars at 942.90 won to hamper the won's sharp pace of depreciation, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The dollar is expected to continue its march higher against the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  throughout the day. \par \par \uc2  -By Cecilia Kang; 822-732-2165; ckang@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 27-10-97 \par \par \uc2  0211GMT \par \par \uc2  1063 1858 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtar082ol\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
