n from 843.40 won Friday. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 16-12-96 \par \par \uc2  2253GMT \par \par \uc2  1033 1865 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011014dscg01r4p\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
